sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM Model Server<br/>5557/TCP ZMQ PUB
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ SUB Socket
    participant Pool as kvevents.Pool<br/>(Sharded Workers)
    participant Adapter as EngineAdapter<br/>(vLLM/SGLang)
    participant Index as kvblock.Index<br/>(LRU/Ristretto/Redis)
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>6379/TCP (optional)
    participant EPP as llm-d-router (EPP)<br/>Host Process
    participant Indexer as kvcache.Indexer
    participant TokenProc as TokenProcessor<br/>(FNV-64a + CBOR)
    participant Scorer as kvblock.Scorer
    participant TokenClient as tokenization.Client
    participant UDS as UDS Tokenizer Sidecar<br/>UDS gRPC
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over vLLM,Redis: Flow 1: KV-Event Ingestion (Write Path)
        vLLM->>ZMQ: BlockStored/BlockRemoved/AllBlocksCleared<br/>ZMQ msgpack, 5557/TCP, No encryption
        ZMQ->>Pool: Route by FNV-1a(pod_id)<br/>In-process
        Pool->>Adapter: Parse msgpack event<br/>In-process
        Adapter->>Pool: Typed KV event
        Pool->>Index: Update block index<br/>In-process
        opt Redis/Valkey backend
            Index->>Redis: SET/DEL block keys<br/>Redis wire, 6379/TCP, Optional TLS
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over EPP,Scorer: Flow 2: Pod Scoring (Read Path)
        EPP->>Indexer: ScoreTokens(tokens, pods)<br/>In-process (library call)
        Indexer->>TokenProc: Compute block keys<br/>In-process
        TokenProc-->>Indexer: Block key sequence
        Indexer->>Index: Lookup block residency<br/>In-process (or Redis 6379/TCP)
        Index-->>Indexer: Per-pod block hits
        Indexer->>Scorer: Score by longest-prefix match<br/>In-process
        Scorer-->>Indexer: Pod scores (cache hit ratio)
        Indexer-->>EPP: Ranked pod scores
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over TokenClient,HF: Flow 3: Tokenization (UDS Sidecar)
        TokenClient->>UDS: Tokenize/RenderChatCompletion<br/>gRPC over UDS, No encryption
        opt First request for model
            UDS->>HF: Download tokenizer files<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS 1.2+, Bearer HF token
            HF-->>UDS: Tokenizer model artifacts
        end
        UDS-->>TokenClient: Token IDs + multimodal features
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over vLLM,Redis: Flow 4: KV-Cache Offloading (FS Backend)
        participant GPU as vLLM (GPU)
        participant FS as llmd-fs-backend
        participant Storage as Shared Storage<br/>(POSIX/S3)
        participant ZMQPub as ZMQ PUB<br/>5559/TCP

        GPU->>FS: Offload KV-cache blocks<br/>In-process (vLLM plugin)
        FS->>Storage: Write blocks<br/>POSIX I/O or HTTPS 443/TCP (S3)
        FS->>ZMQPub: BlockStored event<br/>ZMQ msgpack, 5559/TCP, No encryption
    end
